    //   from inside the body. The consumer therefore sees each element as it is
    //   produced, and when it stops (break / return / a signal) genEmit throws a
    //   private stop marker that unwinds the generator's body. An INFINITE generator
    //   is iterable this way, which is the whole point.
    //
